31:25.166 --> 31:28.742
city. So now I'm open to questions, feedback, or changes to this

31:28.952 --> 31:32.790
current plan. Thank you, that was a great presentation.

31:32.839 --> 31:36.139
Would you jump back a couple slides? Yes. The one that

31:36.639 --> 31:39.699
had— that one right there. Yeah. So just a couple of questions I think would

31:40.199 --> 31:43.071
