31:43.346 --> 31:47.288
I think we should find out how they're determining their

31:47.417 --> 31:50.687
workload. Based on those parks, so if they have you

31:51.187 --> 31:53.979
know how many total parks do you have? How many regional parks? What are how

31:54.479 --> 31:57.094
many teams do you have? How size what are the sizes of your teams and

31:57.594 --> 32:00.915
how many man hours are you planning per park? I think

32:01.654 --> 32:05.411
for me, I want I want to be able to understand how we decide

32:05.748 --> 32:08.221
that we're over or understaffed,

32:09.120 --> 32:12.797
