39:10.459 --> 39:13.796
2. And so I think that there's some additional Costing that we should be aware

39:14.296 --> 39:18.340
of in some of those areas. So, okay, perfect. I thought of one

39:18.356 --> 39:21.873
more thing, um, and I know it's not a municipal

39:21.905 --> 39:25.180
function, but we still have to support it. Knowing the

39:25.196 --> 39:29.451
number of schools that they have and number of crossing guards, I think might

39:29.951 --> 39:33.273
be a useful metric for us because that's something that changes

39:33.851 --> 39:37.608
a lot for us. So yeah, that's a good point, especially for Eagle Mountain.

39:39.580 --> 39:41.772
Perfect. There, we made it a lot easier,

39:42.191 --> 39:45.738
Addie. No, this is great. This is for you

39:54.499 --> 39:56.265
One more thing that's just bouncing around in my head.

39:58.680 --> 40:01.523
