40:13.350 --> 40:16.561
I think that would be interesting to know. Yeah, so just have that ranking at

40:17.061 --> 40:20.656
the end of the analysis? Yeah. Okay, perfect. Yeah,

40:20.672 --> 40:22.245
thank you for all your suggestions.

40:30.610 --> 40:34.237
I think you just created a full-time job. I think you were out

40:34.737 --> 40:37.833
of town when this brainchild came up, and it's— and we

40:38.333 --> 40:41.428
went forward. So I love it. That's great. Okay. I think it'd be really good,

