it, and that would be a really good metrics, like Councilmember

40:54.283 --> 40:57.543
Hewish said. And the reason too I lean back over here,

40:57.591 --> 41:01.123
because I know our time is limited with Addie and Ethan

41:01.623 --> 41:05.458
to help us, and we do want to finish this project. I've spoken

41:05.958 --> 41:08.975
with Natalie and she's going to at least compile data, but like you said,

41:08.991 --> 41:13.150
this could be a bigger project than we hoped, and we

41:13.650 --> 41:16.682
may need to allocate some— And what I would say is this, Mayor, I think

41:17.182 --> 41:20.375
that the data, if we can compile the data in anticipation of next

