3 up and they're working on the building the 4th and plan to do a

01:58:05.876 --> 01:58:08.860
lot more. And they will 100% suck the power and water as they run off

01:58:08.908 --> 01:58:11.493
both. And the people that live here are going to feel it within a few

01:58:11.993 --> 01:58:15.410
years. He said, thought this might interest you. Eagle Mountain is going to be screwed

01:58:15.910 --> 01:58:17.513
in a few years once these are up. And again, I'm surprised there are not

01:58:18.013 --> 01:58:21.286
more upset people about it. He later messaged me and said, I thought I'd let

01:58:21.786 --> 01:58:23.694
you know I found out today that these data centers are for Google and Meta,

01:58:24.159 --> 01:58:27.322
and they may currently have permits or approval for building 9 to 12 of them,

01:58:27.386 --> 01:58:31.254
