Tonight, tonight I want to talk about the city's plans

02:01:02.074 --> 02:01:05.280
to expand the police force by renting additional officers

02:01:05.377 --> 02:01:10.029
from Utah County. While I'm very appreciative to Sheriff Knudson

02:01:10.141 --> 02:01:13.379
and his deputies, I think it's time for the city to stop spinning in

02:01:13.879 --> 02:01:17.273
circles and actually start its own police department.

02:01:17.915 --> 02:01:21.094
It should have been done years ago, and if it's not done now,

02:01:21.223 --> 02:01:24.145
it may turn out to be impossible later. Here's why.

02:01:25.220 --> 02:01:28.752
The city doesn't have a justice court. Why not? Not enough

02:01:28.768 --> 02:01:32.525
crime statistics to support it. Why aren't enough

02:01:33.025 --> 02:01:36.619
crime statistics? Because the city hasn't entered its misdemeanors

02:01:36.635 --> 02:01:39.493
into a system so that the sheriff can issue citations.

02:01:40.312 --> 02:01:43.107
Further, if the If the sheriff wants to arrest somebody,

02:01:43.621 --> 02:01:47.301
it needs to be for something pretty awful because it takes officers

02:01:47.381 --> 02:01:51.334
off the street in Eagle Mountain to drive to Spanish Fork

02:01:51.834 --> 02:01:55.496
to put a person in jail because the city doesn't have a jail. And so

02:01:55.512 --> 02:01:59.272
then the city doesn't get the revenue from the citations

02:01:59.772 --> 02:02:03.161
and the misdemeanors. And there we go around and around and around.

02:02:03.691 --> 02:02:06.744
It's time to get off the merry-go-round and start your own police department.

02:02:06.792 --> 02:02:10.413
Thank you. Eventually, that will serve the citizens better, and it's a more responsible

02:02:10.913 --> 02:02:14.440
solution. To that end, the council is ready

02:02:14.940 --> 02:02:18.738
to be a good fiduciary to the citizens. I am prepared to donate the land

02:02:19.238 --> 02:02:22.972
to build a county jail or a city jail. Thank you.

