Clark. Uh, are there any questions on the motion? Are we good over there?

02:36:54.444 --> 02:36:58.100
Yeah. Okay. Um, Councilmember Clark? Yes. Councilmember Wright?

02:36:58.293 --> 02:37:01.660
Yes. Councilmember Whiting? Yes. Councilmember Wood? Yes. Councilmember Hewish?

02:37:01.997 --> 02:37:05.076
Yes. Okay, we'll go right to item 11A.

02:37:05.509 --> 02:37:08.765
Um, Mr. Mack, and do we still have, uh,

02:37:10.000 --> 02:37:13.768
Russell with us as well? Okay, I didn't see you. Sorry. You're welcome

