we don't have family, so it's like we can't be here. And a lot of

04:18:49.980 --> 04:18:52.640
people are on Zoom or Facebook, of possible. Hopefully my husband said he can listen

04:18:53.140 --> 04:18:56.707
to it, but the letter stated, we hear you. I personally have never seen

04:18:57.207 --> 04:18:59.725
any of you at the public park. I have my toddlers at the park every

