04:20:34.350 --> 04:20:36.530
Like I said, I'm at the park all the time. There's city employees everywhere.

04:20:37.030 --> 04:20:38.869
So I'm like, if there's no money to fix anything, why do have so many

04:20:39.369 --> 04:20:43.184
employees, which is something that somebody made in the meeting last time, and I agree

04:20:43.200 --> 04:20:46.606
with. Um, we're not against supporting public safety, and I

04:20:47.106 --> 04:20:50.802
think that's the most important— Melissa Clark asked earlier. Thank you.

