04:53:12.715 --> 04:53:17.003
in Utah, what's called a revenue-based system, which means we ask

04:53:17.503 --> 04:53:20.826
for amount of money in 2016, and it does change

04:53:21.326 --> 04:53:22.737
a little bit, and this is going to get a little bit more tricky to

04:53:22.753 --> 04:53:26.303
understand. So, I wish I'd get a little leeway on this one, but I'll

04:53:26.803 --> 04:53:30.063
