04:53:37.390 --> 04:53:41.086
why did we get $3 million this year? Because that's the growth number of the

04:53:41.586 --> 04:53:45.424
base, and you get that year's growth and then it goes backwards. But the reason

04:53:45.924 --> 04:53:49.569
that that doesn't equate anything to the budget is because you also increase services.

04:53:49.986 --> 04:53:54.062
It costs you more. So we're still getting a 1.9

04:53:54.175 --> 04:53:58.106
value like here, even though it's $3 million here, that's only $1 million.

04:53:58.507 --> 04:54:01.941
