will address as the council discusses the way that

05:37:30.156 --> 05:37:33.741
we want to look at the revenue shortfall

05:37:33.758 --> 05:37:36.870
from the change in the property tax revenue that would be

05:37:37.351 --> 05:37:40.900
generated. We do have,

