06:28:46.583 --> 06:28:50.116
that are generated from this project area to allocate

06:28:50.616 --> 06:28:54.387
to help pay this so that this can happen. This goes above

06:28:54.887 --> 06:28:58.096
and beyond what the project would otherwise provide.

