06:29:18.785 --> 06:29:21.901
Um, it triggers as soon as the first business is

06:29:22.013 --> 06:29:25.095
open. There is a cap, uh, in in play with this.

06:29:25.784 --> 06:29:29.325
There's a couple of different buckets of dollars that are coming into this

06:29:29.825 --> 06:29:33.683
as well from grant monies from Utah County and from

06:29:34.100 --> 06:29:37.208
