06:29:49.981 --> 06:29:53.665
also covers a number of different provisions. There is a Uh, what's called a TIF

06:29:53.729 --> 06:29:57.433
bond that is part of this process, and that's because sales tax dollars don't

06:29:57.933 --> 06:30:01.731
