06:30:12.732 --> 06:30:15.956
off the TIF bond. That's it. It caps it there, and we're going to try

06:30:16.456 --> 06:30:18.505
and be as aggressive as we can paying that off as quickly as possible.

06:30:19.324 --> 06:30:22.585
Um, I want

06:30:23.085 --> 06:30:24.705
